  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "組織工程與再生醫學",
    "sub_ename": "TISSUE ENGINEERING AND REGENERATIVE MEDICINE",
    "describe_ch": "組織工程與再生醫學是組合材料與生命科學等跨學科之知識與技術，發展輔助、甚至取代器官功能的生物性組織或器官，或改善人體各種組織或器官損傷後功能和形態的一門新興科學。其核心為建立由細胞和生物材料構成的三維立體結構。此一技術改變了傳統的外科手術之做法，提供了一無創傷缺口的修復方式，並能真正達到功能重建的最終目標。因此，課程主要介紹不同生物組織的結構型態、功能，以及如何選擇適當的材料為重建基材。並由目前相關研究成果，看未來發展性。",
    "describe_eh": "Tissue engineering is a new science field during this century, which integrates the principles and methods of materials and life science to develop prosthetic materials for replacing damageable tissues, and resulted in restoration, or improvement tissue functions. Therefore, this course will start from introducing the different structures of native tissues, functions, and then how to choose the suitable materials as to the development of biological substitutes. Current concepts and strategies including drug delivery, tissue and cell transplantation, and in vivo tissue regeneration. We will introduce as well as their respective clinical applications. This course of engineering and life sciences toward the fundamental understanding of normal and pathological mammalian tissues especially as they relate to restore, or improve tissue function.",
    "pre_subname": "FCME3047高分子化學、CHE6083高等流體力學",
    "pre_sub_id3": "FCME3047",
    "pre_sub_ename": "FCME3047 POLYMER CHEMISTRY、CHE6083 ADVANCED FLUID MECHANICS",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解生醫材料設計原理",
      "describe_en": "Have a general understanding how to design biomaterials."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備結合材料與化工原理設計類人體組織",
      "describe_en": "Apply scientific fundamentals and concept of materials and chemical engineering to design a biomimetic in vitro system"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "以團隊模式進行專題報告",
      "describe_en": "Organize a team project and complete a professional report."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "創造具有可用於修補組織之良好生物相容性人工組織",
      "describe_en": "Create a biocompatible artificial tissue for repairing the damaged tissues."
    }
  ],
